VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'with a database behind them. Two are basically markdown and shell scripts. Two sit in the middle. I opened all six and ranked them. Worst to best. The ranking is not the star count. It\'s'

[00:37] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'three questions. Can you run it? Can you check what it claims? And does it check that you\'re allowed? Number six. Z3R0. 612 stars. And honestly, the most complete architecture on this list.'

